elaine: added small JS/py/go snippets for retry. TS sketch:```ts
function retryWithJitter(fn, attempts = 5) {
  for (let i=0;i<attempts;i++) {
    try {
      return await fn();
    } catch (e) {
      const backoff = Math.min(1000 * 2**i, 30000);
      const jitter = Math.random() * 200;
      await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r, backoff + jitter));
    }
  }
  throw new Error('max attempts');
}```

morgan: that looks good. small nit: use jitter that scales with backoff (e.g., backoff * 0.1) to avoid tiny fixed jitter.

